// Test fixture: a two-deep frontier, (3,5) then (11,9), so top_x/top_z and
// pop_room can be pinned against a stack with more than one element (a
// one-deep stack can't tell "pop everything" from "pop the top").
stack_two_rooms_setup() {
  create_maze();
  create_carving_state(3, 5);
  push_room(11, 9);
} return void;
():() then top_x:(11)
():() then top_z:("top_z 9")
